<title>USA: TF Purifiner says CEO, CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>TF Purifiner says CEO, CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TF Purifiner Inc said on Thursday that Richard Ford, the company's chief executive officer and chief financial officer had resigned for undisclosed reasons.</p>
<p>Ford will be succeeded in those positions by Keith Hart, currently the president and chief operating officer of the company, TF Purifiner said in a statement.</p>
<p>TF Purifiner Inc manufactures an oil purification system.</p>
